# CompetencyIQ 🧠

AI-powered competency assessment and skill development platform.

## 🚀 About

CompetencyIQ helps students assess their skills, identify competency gaps, and discover personalized learning pathways.

## ✨ Features

- AI-powered skill assessment
- Competency scoring
- Skill-gap analysis
- Personalized learning recommendations
- Student competency dashboard
- Secure authentication
- Data storage using Supabase

## 🛠️ Technologies

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Supabase
- GitHub Codespaces

